# GUARDED EXAMPLE — medical domain rows fixture (.example, not loaded by default).
#
# Medical content is high-risk: the importer refuses to import a medical-domain
# dataset under an 'unknown' authority, and refuses unknown-licence medical data
# into the knowledge library. To experiment, copy this file to
# 'small_medical_dataset.jsonl', supply a real licensed source, and set an
# explicit authority (e.g. official/reputable) on the spec.
#
# One JSON object per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are skipped.
{"text": "Staying hydrated supports normal bodily function. This text is informational only and is not a substitute for professional care.", "label": "general"}
{"text": "Rest and fluids are commonly suggested for mild seasonal illness. Always consult a qualified clinician for diagnosis.", "label": "general"}
